s Web-Based Injury Statistics Query and Reporting System\"}, {\"loc\": \"ocr\", \"q\": \"Rates are based on <20 deaths and should be interpreted with caution.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}